WEBVTT

00:00.160 --> 00:01.520
I'm going to introduce you to the platform

00:01.520 --> 00:03.320
SNITEM OPALE that I had the opportunity to

00:03.320 --> 00:06.000
during my permanent contract at Soft Concept

00:06.000 --> 00:08.880
for almost a year. Opale

00:08.880 --> 00:09.800
is a tool for managing the

00:09.800 --> 00:11.480
different stages to get the

00:11.480 --> 00:14.200
MDR certification. So MDR is for

00:14.200 --> 00:16.880
Medical Device Regulation and

00:16.880 --> 00:18.400
Snitem is the French National Union of

00:18.400 --> 00:20.040
the medical technology industry.

00:20.320 --> 00:21.840
Then it is not the Snitem that provides

00:22.000 --> 00:24.600
certification, but it is well under its

00:24.600 --> 00:26.960
initiative that the member manufacturers

00:28.800 --> 00:31.680
will proceed with the different stages

00:31.920 --> 00:34.160
in order to obtain this certification.

00:35.680 --> 00:38.240
Two types of profiles for the application,

00:39.120 --> 00:41.120
on the one hand, administrator or Snitem and

00:41.120 --> 00:43.880
on the other hand, manufacturer or adherent.

00:44.880 --> 00:47.400
The Snitem administrator or user

00:47.440 --> 00:49.600
will be able to have a macro view

00:51.040 --> 00:53.520
and possibly have a

00:54.160 --> 00:56.560
ability to manage access:

00:56.560 --> 00:58.400
manufacturers and users who

00:59.680 --> 01:02.640
represent them. The

01:02.640 --> 01:04.640
manufacturer, he will be able to

01:05.280 --> 01:08.160
enter data, therefore

01:08.160 --> 01:10.960
financial data,

01:11.040 --> 01:11.840
market data,

01:11.840 --> 01:13.920
general data.

01:15.440 --> 01:17.520
And with this data that it will provide,

01:18.760 --> 01:21.360
it will feed a micro dashboard

01:21.760 --> 01:24.640
that a decision-maker will be able to consult.

01:24.880 --> 01:27.680
And it will also feed

01:27.920 --> 01:30.040
the macro table that can be seen by the

01:30.040 --> 01:31.560
SNITEM users or

01:31.600 --> 01:34.200
platform administrators.

01:35.040 --> 01:37.440
If I log in as an administrator.

01:37.440 --> 01:39.240
So, administrator. The difference

01:39.240 --> 01:40.880
between the administrator and a SNITEM

01:40.880 --> 01:43.520
profile, even though the

01:43.520 --> 01:46.000
functionality remains almost identical,

01:46.800 --> 01:49.360
the SNITEM will not have

01:50.200 --> 01:52.280
user management

01:52.280 --> 01:54.200
,the manufacturers being the

01:54.440 --> 01:56.960
device Producers

01:56.960 --> 01:58.800
whether it is medicines,

01:58.960 --> 02:00.840
prosthetics, et cetera.

02:02.160 --> 02:05.160
So there the administrator profile will

02:05.160 --> 02:07.120
have the macro chart

02:07.920 --> 02:09.640
Diagnostic status compound, decision,

02:09.680 --> 02:12.240
monitoring and access management. So there

02:12.240 --> 02:13.840
we have the number of registered

02:13.920 --> 02:15.360
companies, the number of

02:15.360 --> 02:16.960
created products, the number of TDs created.

02:16.960 --> 02:18.960
So a TD is a technical

02:20.480 --> 02:21.120
documentation

02:23.520 --> 02:26.000
We also have the decision. So there, it's a

02:26.080 --> 02:28.800
dynami reporting

02:28.800 --> 02:30.880
of the status of the TDs for example, the

02:30.880 --> 02:33.840
piloting, manufacturers

02:34.640 --> 02:37.600
and users. So, SNITEM,

02:41.220 --> 02:43.180
we have the same menus

02:44.620 --> 02:47.100
without access management and

02:47.100 --> 02:49.820
we also have a guide

02:49.820 --> 02:50.300
so as to use the platform

02:52.940 --> 02:55.900
quite detailed with the notions a little

02:55.900 --> 02:57.780
complicated that are addressed

02:58.880 --> 03:00.400
in this platform. Knowing that the

03:00.480 --> 03:03.040
platform is intended to respect

03:03.560 --> 03:05.600
ISO standard

03:05.920 --> 03:07.440
13485

03:08.720 --> 03:11.120
for medical

03:11.760 --> 03:14.400
software. So for a

03:14.400 --> 03:16.240
manufacturer, there will be

03:17.360 --> 03:19.960
the ability to import data via

03:19.960 --> 03:22.920
an Excel file. So we have a form

03:22.920 --> 03:25.800
Excel of the model and we will be able to

03:25.800 --> 03:28.240
download here and drop it off.

03:28.800 --> 03:30.000
It goes automatically

03:31.520 --> 03:34.000
feed products, QMS or TD. Then

03:34.000 --> 03:35.440
QMS in fact is the

03:35.440 --> 03:37.920
quality management system.

03:39.440 --> 03:40.400
And TD, as I said earlier,

03:40.400 --> 03:43.360
it's Technical Documentation, MD

03:43.360 --> 03:45.440
being Medical Devices.

03:48.640 --> 03:51.200
So we can create new products.

03:51.360 --> 03:53.560
You can also display or not the

03:53.560 --> 03:55.920
different columns. So, for example,

03:55.920 --> 03:56.880
for a product.

03:59.200 --> 04:01.120
For example, a suction probe

04:01.120 --> 04:03.600
tracheal. So here, we

04:05.280 --> 04:07.040
will be able to fill in the different

04:07.040 --> 04:08.480
product data, so the data

04:08.480 --> 04:11.320
for example, the

04:11.320 --> 04:12.560
market data,

04:12.560 --> 04:13.600
technical data and

04:13.600 --> 04:14.440
free comments.

04:19.670 --> 04:21.390
We will also be able to

04:22.270 --> 04:24.230
Associate a product with a TD.

04:25.470 --> 04:28.430
We will also be able to delete

04:29.310 --> 04:30.990
the different associations.

04:33.800 --> 04:35.680
You can also remove the product. For

04:35.680 --> 04:38.120
the QMS, it's going to be the same principle so

04:38.120 --> 04:39.840
there will also be data to be

04:39.840 --> 04:42.080
to fill. So financial data,

04:42.080 --> 04:44.240
technical, regulatory and steering

04:44.640 --> 04:47.120
for a regulatory

04:47.200 --> 04:50.160
decision and an audit that

04:50.160 --> 04:52.280
will take place to make the transition

04:52.280 --> 04:54.480
between the MDD and the MDR. MDR is the

04:54.480 --> 04:56.400
new regulation, MDD is

04:56.400 --> 04:56.720
the old one.

05:00.040 --> 05:02.400
We will also have data on the

05:02.800 --> 05:05.760
steering with a percentage

05:05.760 --> 05:08.160
update. We will be able to delete

05:08.160 --> 05:09.040
the QMS.

05:11.040 --> 05:13.920
For the TDs, we will have different

05:13.920 --> 05:15.760
status, in transition,

05:16.400 --> 05:19.120
new. We will also be able to

05:19.120 --> 05:21.080
provide data on the diagnostic

05:21.080 --> 05:24.080
status, on the SMQ/TD/

05:24.080 --> 05:26.240
products, managing the TD

05:26.240 --> 05:29.200
and tracking monitoring

05:29.200 --> 05:29.920
statistics.

05:35.560 --> 05:38.120
In the monitoring, we'll see

05:38.160 --> 05:39.800
the overall progress of the TD, whether

05:39.800 --> 05:41.560
the deadlines have been met, if

05:41.560 --> 05:43.440
the evaluation was planned...

05:47.760 --> 05:50.320
The milestones, so the current date, the

05:51.120 --> 05:52.720
expiry date of the MDD

05:53.040 --> 05:53.680
certificate.

05:58.160 --> 06:00.720
Data can also be filled in

06:00.720 --> 06:02.560
on the company,

06:05.280 --> 06:08.240
in particular the size of the company,

06:08.240 --> 06:09.440
French capitals and

06:09.440 --> 06:10.560
total business capital.

06:16.680 --> 06:18.320
We can disconnect.
